WEBVTT

00:02:28.186 --> 00:02:30.646
and that means we have two problems.

00:02:30.688 --> 00:02:33.900
The first problem
is that governments don't love it

00:02:33.900 --> 00:02:36.986
when weird new stuff gets born.

00:02:37.695 --> 00:02:40.907
Second problem is that governments
also don't love it

00:02:40.907 --> 00:02:44.619
when familiar old stuff dies.

00:02:44.660 --> 00:02:47.413
So let's talk about the new stuff first.

00:02:49.665 --> 00:02:55.463
The thing about capitalism
is that it is an emergent system.

00:02:55.504 --> 00:03:02.261
It's, like all evolutionary mechanisms,
powered by mutations.